### 2. PROJECT AND BUSINESS CONTEXT

Company building the solution: FENUCS GROUP LTD.

Client: Cooknow.

Product name: Cooknow Business Management System.

Product type: Responsive browser-based business management application with an integrated ticketing module.

Business objective:

Develop a convincing, interactive prototype demonstrating how Cooknow could manage its inventory, suppliers, customers, transactions, receipts, waybills, deliveries, and customer or internal operational issues through one organised platform.

The prototype will be demonstrated to Cooknow's decision-makers to validate workflows, collect feedback, and support discussion of the proposed software project.

The prototype is not yet the production system. It must look and behave convincingly while remaining honest about simulated functionality, unimplemented integrations, and the limitations of sample data.

